          "text": "I challenge this a bit\n\n(a) Codex was started as an internal tool. The goal was explicitly to build what was the highest leverage tool to accelerate infrastructure buildout.\n(b) I don’t think the Meta vs non-Meta is particularly enlightening here. Most of us who came from older tech companies were surprised at how far OpenAI had taken Python scripts and had a desire to scale OpenAI further.\n(c) A ton of infrastructure and internal tools were built over the last few years, it’s not the case that we were just waiting for AGI to appear.",
